From f52921d6b3cac3066c755495c3b2e14b392022ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Ammann <daniel.ammann@bytesatwork.ch>
Date: Tue, 5 Apr 2022 15:06:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: ti: k3-am625-byteengine/bytedevkit: Add byteDEVKIT
 support
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add necessary dts + dtsi to use all features from byteDEVKIT.

Signed-off-by: Daniel Ammann <daniel.ammann@bytesatwork.ch>
Signed-off-by: Stephan Dünner <stephan.duenner@bytesatwork.ch>
Signed-off-by: Rico Ganahl <rico.ganahl@bytesatwork.ch>
---
